WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.162
BOD 25-01 is narrower
and much more concrete.

2
00:00:04.162 --> 00:00:07.842
CISA issued it in December
2024 for every production

3
00:00:07.842 --> 00:00:10.949
cloud tenant with a
finalized SCuBA baseline.

4
00:00:10.949 --> 00:00:12.707
It has six required actions,

5
00:00:12.707 --> 00:00:17.673
from inventorying tenants and deploying
the SCuBA tools, to implementing the

6
00:00:17.673 --> 00:00:21.798
mandatory policies and explaining
deviations with each report;

7
00:00:21.798 --> 00:00:23.250
the slide has the dates.

8
00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:30.150
The mandatory list is a subset of the
baselines: for Microsoft 365 it's 50 policies.

9
00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:36.675
Google Workspace is in scope now too,
with its policies due December 1, 2026.

10
00:00:36.675 --> 00:00:41.079
Scope is limited to software as a
service, so Azure subscriptions are out

11
00:00:41.079 --> 00:00:45.850
even when they share the tenant, and
on-premises Active Directory is untouched.

12
00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:49.375
Inventory, deployment and
explanations take days.

13
00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:52.028
Implementing the policies is architecture,

14
00:00:52.028 --> 00:00:54.825
and that's what the
directive really exists for.

15
00:00:54.825 --> 00:00:57.310
Next, the two tools that measure it.
